    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d497">

                <pb facs="0674" n="580" sameAs="frus:frus1896/pg580"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Chapin, Acting
                        United States Consular agent, to Mr. Olney.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Johannesburg</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1896-05-02"><hi rendition="#italic">May 2,
                        1896</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>No decision yet as to substitute sentences. Hope for five [fine] and banishment.
                    Hammond’s health uncertain Have asked Government to allow him out of jail under
                    restrictions. Have I full powers in treating with Government as to prisoners?
                    Hammond and others desire it. Please refer to President.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Chapin.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
